  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.4 — Bug fixes\n• Dashboard now connects and streams logs correctly in Worker Service and Console App — DashboardServer was missing DashboardTokenStore DI registration causing hub connection to fail\n• Dashboard page loads with correct auth mode in Worker Service and Console App — __AUTH_MODE__ placeholder was not replaced causing the auth badge to show and block connections\n• CSV export now renders special characters correctly — UTF-8 BOM added so Excel and Windows CSV viewers decode em dashes and non-ASCII characters correctly instead of showing garbled text\nv1.0.3 — Bug fixes + improvements\n• Dashboard page JS syntax error fixed; footer and sidebar version labels corrected\n• CSV export includes all enriched properties as additional columns\n• Export button correctly shows JSON and CSV options\nv1.0.2 — Bug fix: Dashboard page JS syntax error fixed; Export button split into JSON and CSV\nv1.0.1 — New features: Copy correlation ID, shareable URL, regex search, buffer capacity, CSV export, reconnect indicator\nv1.0.0 — Stable release: real-time SignalR streaming, 500-event buffer, level/service/search filters, 6 auth modes, Redis backplane\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/CHANGELOG.md",
